## Why This Is Asked
Assesses practical testing of async, fault-tolerant workflows and how beginners wire tests across layers.

## Key Concepts
- Async pipelines, at-least-once vs dedup
- Idempotency, deduplication IDs
- Retries/backoff, fault injection
- Test types: unit/integration/e2e

## Code Example
```javascript
// naive dedup example
function process(msg, store){
  if (store.seen(msg.id)) return;
  // process
  store.markSeen(msg.id);
}
```

